<section>
  <h1>ScreenLock v1.0.15</h1>
  <h2>Highlights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Universal binary, running natively on Intel (x86_64) and Apple Silicon (arm64) Macs</li>
    <li>Signed with Developer ID and notarized by Apple, without Gatekeeper warnings</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>See <a href="https://github.com/Talljack/screen-lock/compare/v1.0.14...v1.0.15">changes since v1.0.14</a> for full details.</p>
  <h2>Install</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Download <code>ScreenLock.dmg</code>.</li>
    <li>Open the DMG and drag <code>ScreenLock.app</code> to <code>Applications</code>.</li>
    <li>Launch the app from the menu bar.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
